<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vencor cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vencor cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc said on Tuesday it cut its rating of Vencor Inc to a buy from its prior rating of strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the operator of hospitals and nursing homes fell 1-3/8 to 30-7/8 in early morning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
